{"script":"sub_0_09_1","des":"角色突破","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":380,"y":-264.80000000000007,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"trans":true,"scaleX":0.9},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":380,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"text":"[show]那个啊。你有听说过“瓶颈”这个词没有？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2","y":10,"d":0.8,"x":0},"key":"shake"},{"para":{"text":"[show]那个……我先说好哦，我没有在怪你的意思啦。[r]我很感激有你帮忙汇总战斗经验。但最近我越来越觉得……[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]不论怎么看那些战斗经验，我都学不到什么东西——[l]就好像到了“瓶颈”了。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]你说既然能击败地窖里的大蜘蛛，就已经超过许多契约者的水平了……[r][l]唉。这种时候就不要敷衍我了啦。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]是那个毛耳朵说过的？那……那既然她都这么说……我就勉强接受了吧。哼哼。[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]唉不对！总之就是很烦！超过许多契约者也不行，我想变得更强！[r][l]不管是什么修炼我都要做！我想得到突破！这么说你懂了吧！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]你的意思是说……去找附近的强者，问问她们的经验？[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"text":"[show]嗯！有道理！这么说来，驿站好像确实有一名强者……[r][l]——我们现在就去问问她吧！[l][cm]","charaName":"米托拉","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"scaleY":0.9,"layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"noIn":false,"x":380,"y":-264.80000000000007,"transTime":300,"scaleX":0.9,"mirrow":false,"trans":true,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}